=================================

data/boards.json
----------------
The company-to-ATS board registry in `data/boards.json` is derived from
`data/companies.json` in:

    Automated-List-Of-Summer-2027-and-Fall-2026-Tech-Internships
    https://github.com/zshah101/Automated-List-Of-Summer-2027-and-Fall-2026-Tech-Internships

Retrieved 2026-08-14. Used under the MIT License, reproduced below.

Changes made: filtered to the four ATS platforms that expose a plain JSON board
endpoint (greenhouse, ashby, lever, smartrecruiters); added a `priority` list of
boards verified by hand; added one board absent upstream (`axelera`), marked
with `"added_by": "contributie"`.

